        "contract": "(define checklist (cbcl) @anuna\n  (:resource-requirements\n    ((max-depth 16)\n     (max-expansion-size 4096)\n     (verification-time 1000)))\n\n  (:roles (owner (* member)))\n\n  (extend open (to title) :from owner :to (owner member)\n    (tell to :title title))\n\n  (extend check (to item done) :from member :to (owner member)\n    (tell to :item item :done done))\n\n  (extend drop (to item) :from owner :to (owner member)\n    (tell to :item item))\n\n  (shape open\n    (require :title string))\n  (shape check\n    (require :clock hlc) (require :item string)\n    (require :done bool))\n  (shape drop\n    (require :item string))\n\n  (protocol\n    (then begin open)\n    (then open check)\n    (then open drop))\n\n  (state\n    (title (initial open :title))\n    (items (lww-map check :item :done :clock drop))))",
